1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,330
Tonight two guests will knock on your door.

2
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,690
Two? Who are they?

3
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:11,274
The first one is small.

4
00:00:11,324 --> 00:00:14,550
Head bowed. A paper in his hands.

5
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:15,468
Let him in.

6
00:00:15,518 --> 00:00:17,770
A guest is as honored as your own father.

7
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:22,690
The paper says: you sent the client the wrong file.

8
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,581
Well... it happens.

9
00:00:24,631 --> 00:00:26,340
I'll fix it tomorrow.

10
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:30,115
Behind him came the second one.

11
00:00:30,165 --> 00:00:31,236
Big. Cold.

12
00:00:31,286 --> 00:00:35,160
He only wants to stand at the door.

13
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:37,020
Let him. What's the harm?

14
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:41,860
Now he whispers to you: "You're always like this."

15
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:44,690
Maybe it's true...

16
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:50,350
Now he has taken the seat of honor: "They'll fire you."

17
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:51,432
And if they do?

18
00:00:51,482 --> 00:00:52,840
What will I tell my family?

19
00:00:53,190 --> 00:00:53,870
Night.

20
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:58,008
The first guest is already asleep.

21
00:00:58,058 --> 00:01:01,780
The second sits by your pillow.

22
00:01:02,130 --> 00:01:03,781
Hey, this is my house!

23
00:01:03,831 --> 00:01:04,940
Make him leave!

24
00:01:05,290 --> 00:01:06,493
He won't leave.

25
00:01:06,543 --> 00:01:09,166
You invited him to tea yourself.

26
00:01:09,216 --> 00:01:12,340
Now he's not a guest, he's the master.

27
00:01:12,690 --> 00:01:14,210
Who is he?

28
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:17,910
His name is "I'm no good."

29
00:01:17,960 --> 00:01:22,880
He always comes right after a mistake.

30
00:01:23,230 --> 00:01:25,160
And the first one? The Mistake?

31
00:01:25,510 --> 00:01:27,778
The Mistake is a real guest.

32
00:01:27,828 --> 00:01:31,090
Welcome it: admit it, apologize, fix it.

33
00:01:31,140 --> 00:01:33,740
By morning it leaves on its own.

34
00:01:34,090 --> 00:01:35,200
And the second one?

35
00:01:35,550 --> 00:01:37,584
Ask him three questions.

36
00:01:37,634 --> 00:01:39,494
What exactly happened?

37
00:01:39,544 --> 00:01:41,231
What am I making up?

38
00:01:41,281 --> 00:01:44,270
What one step can I take right now?

39
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:49,560
My boss only said "send the file again"...

40
00:01:49,910 --> 00:01:52,247
There. That's the fact.

41
00:01:52,297 --> 00:01:55,880
The rest is just the guest talking.

42
00:01:56,230 --> 00:01:59,835
Mistakes knock on everyone's door.

43
00:01:59,885 --> 00:02:05,210
Whether you let their companion in is your choice.

